### 刷新源（catpm update）真实执行（原始输出）
## 2026-11-11T15:55:54Z  cwd=/root/.hermes-web-ui/.ekko/workspace/default/person-main-f5f99dc5-b73a-417a-baf6-5b3f41382e6c/srcprobe/work/proj
== 0. 说明：catpm 0.5.5 的索引缓存是「项目内」的（.catpm-cache/index-cache），无全局缓存；
      在服务器主项目目录执行 update 即刷新该项目的源缓存。
== 1. catpm init
catpm: created catpm.json
  add deps with: catpm add <name>[@spec]
exit=0

== 2. catpm update（--version 确认二进制）
catpm 0.5.5 (for CatBase 0.1.8)
catpm: refreshing package index from 2 source(s)
  OK   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/monikalnbo/catpm-registry/main  9 entries (first refresh)
  OK   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/monikalnbo/catpm/c78a90f/registry  5 entries (first refresh)
catpm: index cache updated: 2 ok, 0 failed, 14 entries total (age out after 86400s; override with CATPM_INDEX_TTL)
exit=0

